words = PackedStringArray(
"Basics",
"Welcome, commander. You lead the Derrick League. Your credits and power are up here, and the menu button is at the start. Tap Next.",
"Drag one finger across the map to move the view.",
"Pinch your fingers apart to zoom in. The view settles on one of three zoom levels.",
"Tap the round radar. The whole map unfolds, and a tap or drag on it jumps the view there.",
"Black ground is unexplored and dim ground is out of sight. You only see enemies where your units see now. Tap Next.",
"Press and hold on the ground, then drag a box round your squads to select them.",
"Tap CLEAR to drop the selection. A box on empty ground, or a tap on bare ground, does it too. Tap Next.",
"Double-tap one squad to select every squad of that kind on screen.",
"With your squads selected, tap the ground to send them there. STOP halts them where they stand.",
"Now send them across the ridge. Rock and water block everyone, so they walk round. You can also hold a finger on the radar map to send them there.",
"Tap BUILD to open the build drawer. The game goes on behind it.",
"The power bar is red: your {refinery} uses more power than you make. Tap Next, then build a {power_plant}.",
"Tap the {power_plant} card to queue it. When it says Ready, tap it to place it.",
"Drag the ghost to a free spot, then tap the check mark. BUILD still works while you place.",
"Touch the map and the drawer slides away. Hold a card to cancel the last one you queued. Tap Next.",
"Your tanker brings in credits. Select it and tap the oil field to send it to work.",
"Build a {barracks} the same way: BUILD, tap its card, wait for Ready, place it.",
"Open the Infantry tab and tap {rifle_squad} twice. They appear beside the {barracks}.",
"Select the {barracks} and tap the ground: new squads gather at that flag. Tap Next.",
"Select squads and tap the plus to save them as a group. Hold a group's number to overwrite it with your selection.",
"Enemy squads are coming. When you are hit out of view, a red message tells you: tap it to jump there, and watch the red wedge on the radar. Tap Next.",
"Select your squads and tap an enemy to attack it. They keep fighting the next one until none is left.",
"Tap the menu button to pause. Restart, Surrender and Exit ask first. Leaving the app saves the match: CONTINUE on the main menu picks it up.",
"To win, destroy the enemy headquarters and every building that trains units. Skirmish lets you pick Easy, Normal or Hard. Tap Next.",
"Strikes and the satellite",
"Your {fossil_strike} is charged. The round button above BUILD is its strike button: the ring fills while it charges. Tap Next.",
"Tap the ready button, then tap the map where the enemy squads stand. A ring shows how far the strike reaches; tap again to move it.",
"Tap the check mark to fire. Everyone sees a red ring and a warning triangle on the target while it closes.",
"When the ring closes the ground splits: every ground unit and building inside is hit, yours too, and a crater stays. Tap Next.",
"A building with an amber bolt over it is switched off, yours or the enemy's. A Dusk Array does that to what it hits. Tap Next.",
"Your {fossil_space} is a space centre. Its one charge fills from the start; when it is ready the strike button serves it. Tap Next.",
"The sweep needs no target. Tap the ready button, then the lit check mark.",
"The whole map is yours to see until the {fossil_space} is destroyed or sold. Enemy buildings stay dimly on the map. Tap Next.",
"If the {fossil_space} is switched off or you run low on power, the sweep pauses and comes back by itself. Tap Next.",
"When an enemy fires its sweep you get one warning line and a satellite badge on your screen. Tap Next.",
"Aircraft and carriers",
"Your airfield has four landing pads, one aircraft per pad. A new one needs a radar and costs credits: BUILD, Structures. Tap Next.",
"Open the Flight tab and tap {fossil_fighter}. It appears over a free pad.",
"Tap the aircraft itself, not its shadow, to select it.",
"A fighter hits aircraft only. Tap an enemy tank and nothing is ordered: the marker shakes. Tap Next.",
"A bomber drops its bombs, flies home to reload and waits on its pad. Tap an enemy to send it out again. Tap Next.",
"With aircraft selected, tap HOME and they fly back to their pads to reload and be repaired. Tap Next.",
"An enemy aircraft is over your base. Your {fossil_aa} fires on its own, at aircraft only. Tap Next.",
"Open the Vehicles tab and tap {fossil_bunk_wagon}. A carrier has no gun: it carries squads.",
"Select squads, tap BOARD, tap the carrier, then the check mark. Tap Next.",
"Select the loaded carrier, tap UNLOAD, tap the ground, then the check mark. Tap Next.",
"Repair, sale and mines",
"Tap one of your {power_plant} buildings to select it.",
"MEND repairs a building for a share of its price. Tap Next.",
"SELL needs two taps: the first arms it and shows the refund, the second sells. Tap Next.",
"With your headquarters gone, selling your last barracks or factory asks first, because it loses the match. Tap Next.",
"Enemy squads are attacking your base. Hurt vehicles need repair. Tap Next.",
"Double-tap a tank to select both.",
"Hurt vehicles drive to your {fossil_weld_shed} when you tap REPAIR, and are fixed there for credits. Tap Next.",
"Open the Infantry tab and tap {fossil_patchers}. A medic squad mends hurt squads near it for free, but carries no weapon.",
"Open the Vehicles tab and tap {fossil_shot_truck}. It lays mines and finds hidden ones.",
"Select the truck, tap MINE, tap the ground, then the check mark. The button counts your mines. Tap Next.",
"Enemy mines are hidden: no mark, nothing on the radar. A ground unit that walks over one sets it off. Your truck finds them. Tap Next.",
"TUTORIAL",
"Follow the coach cards to learn the controls.",
"Learn to aim a strike and to use the satellite.",
"Learn aircraft, Home and carriers.",
"Learn repair, sale and mines."
)
